{"4203610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Gate", "steam_appid": 4203610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A monstrous force known as <strong>Danav</strong> has destroyed Eddi’s village, seizing nearby forests, mountains, and natural sanctuaries. While the villagers flee to safety, Eddi chooses to fight back. Danav’s army pours through sinister <strong>portal gates</strong>, spreading chaos and destruction across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy the portals</strong> to cut off Danav’s army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle waves of soldiers</strong> and uncover the hidden gate that brought Danav into the village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat Danav</strong> and restore peace to your homeland.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Gameplay Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized RPG + FPS hybrid</strong>: Experience a unique blend of role-playing progression and first-person shooting action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic battles</strong>: Face hordes of Danav’s soldiers across forests, mountains, and ruined villages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; progression</strong>: Earn valuable items, powerful new weapons, and coins as you defeat enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village rebuilding</strong>: Use collected coins to reconstruct houses and bring life back to your village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final showdown</strong>: Confront Danav at the hidden last gate and secure victory for your people.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A monstrous force known as <strong>Danav</strong> has destroyed Eddi’s village, seizing nearby forests, mountains, and natural sanctuaries. While the villagers flee to safety, Eddi chooses to fight back. Danav’s army pours through sinister <strong>portal gates</strong>, spreading chaos and destruction across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy the portals</strong> to cut off Danav’s army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle waves of soldiers</strong> and uncover the hidden gate that brought Danav into the village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat Danav</strong> and restore peace to your homeland.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Gameplay Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized RPG + FPS hybrid</strong>: Experience a unique blend of role-playing progression and first-person shooting action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic battles</strong>: Face hordes of Danav’s soldiers across forests, mountains, and ruined villages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; progression</strong>: Earn valuable items, powerful new weapons, and coins as you defeat enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village rebuilding</strong>: Use collected coins to reconstruct houses and bring life back to your village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final showdown</strong>: Confront Danav at the hidden last gate and secure victory for your people.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Last Gate follows Eddi, a villager who fights back after the monster Danav destroys his home. With portal gates unleashing armies across forests and mountains, Eddi must destroy them all and face Danav at the final hidden gate to save his village.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203610/453d6c3641230d7360b5e8b42b4d26081455f205/header.jpg?t=1766680075", "capsule_image": "https